{"articleNo":"514120","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=514120&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교외행사] [나주교육진흥재단] 전남 나주 출신 대학생을 위한 2025년 해외 유학생 지원 장학생 선발","writer":"국제교류교육원","writeDate":"2025.05.15","hit":"3143","attachments":[{"name":"[나주교육진흥재단] 2025 해외유학생 지원장학금 선발계획.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=514120&attachNo=143514"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<pre style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; overflow: auto; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); text-wrap-mode: wrap; overflow-wrap: break-word; line-height: 1.625rem; word-break: keep-all;\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">나주교육진흥재단에서 </span><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">전남 나주 출신 대학생</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">들이 지역과 세계를 선도하는 글로벌 인재로 성장할 수 있도록&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">해외 교환학생 장학금을 지급하고자 하오니 관심있는 나주 출신 학생들의 많은 관심바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px;\"><br></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;「2025년 해외 유학생 지원 장학금」</span></span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; text-align: center;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; line-height: 24px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">❍ </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">지급 대상자</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; line-height: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 12pt;\">관내 중</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 12pt;\">·</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 12pt;\">고등학교를 졸업하고</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 12pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 12pt;\">매학년도 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 12pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 12pt;\">학기 해외 교환 학생으로 선발된 국내 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 12pt;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 12pt;\">년제 대학교 재학생 중 신청 자격 충족 학생</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; line-height: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 14pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; line-height: 24px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">❍ </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">지급 기준 </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; line-height: 24px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">   </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 12pt;\">1.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 12pt;\">신청자격</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; line-height: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 12pt;\">   &nbsp;1) 본인 또는 부</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 12pt;\">·</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 12pt;\">모가 나주시에 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 12pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 12pt;\">년 이상 거주 중이며&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 12pt;\">본인이 나주시에서 중</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 12pt;\">·</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 12pt;\">고등학교를 모두 졸업한 자&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; line-height: 24px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;   2) </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 12pt;\">기초생활수급자</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 12pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 12pt;\">차상위계층</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 12pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.2pt; font-size: 12pt;\">소득 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.2pt; font-size: 12pt;\">1~8</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.2pt; font-size: 12pt;\">구간 해당자</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; line-height: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.2pt; font-size: 12pt;\">    &nbsp;3) 교환학생 지원 목적으로 교외장학금을 지원받지 않은 자</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; line-height: 24px;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; line-height: 24px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">   </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 12pt;\">2.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 12pt;\">서류 심사</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 12pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 12pt;\">지원자격 충족여부</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 12pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 12pt;\">지원서 및 자기소개서</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 12pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 12pt;\">및 면접심사</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 12pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 12pt;\">글로벌 </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.2pt; font-size: 12pt;\">역량 및 성장가능성</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.2pt; font-size: 12pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.2pt; font-size: 12pt;\">를 통해</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; line-height: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.2pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 연 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.2pt; font-size: 12pt;\">5</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.2pt; font-size: 12pt;\">명을 선발하여 각 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.2pt; font-size: 12pt;\">300</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.2pt; font-size: 12pt;\">만원씩을 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.2pt; font-size: 12pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.2pt; font-size: 12pt;\">회 분할&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.2pt;\">지급</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.2pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.2pt;\">총 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.2pt;\">600</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.2pt;\">만원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.2pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; line-height: 3.73333px; letter-spacing: -1.2pt; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">  </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">  </span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; line-height: 24px;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; line-height: 24px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">❍ </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">장학금 신청</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; line-height: 24px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">   </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">1.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">신청 기간 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">: 2025. 5. 12.(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">) ~ 5. 23(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">) 18:00 </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; line-height: 24px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">   </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">2.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">신청 방법 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">우편 또는 이메일</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">, (</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">재</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">나주교육진흥재단 사무국</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; line-height: 24px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">      </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 12pt;\">※</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 12pt;\">우편 접수 주소 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 12pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 12pt;\">나주시 빛가람동 상야 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 12pt;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 12pt;\">길 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 12pt;\">22(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 12pt;\">대양스퀘어가든 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 12pt;\">407</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 12pt;\">호</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 12pt;\">) </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; line-height: 24px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">          </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 12pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 12pt;\">재</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 12pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 12pt;\">나주교육진흥재단 장학금 담당자</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; text-align: center;\"></p><div id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" class=\"hwp_editor_board_content\" data-hjsonver=\"1.0\" data-jsonlen=\"20557\"></div><p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; line-h